                <note rend="inline" type="source">551.5 F 1/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-12-17T15:00:00-05:00">December 17, 1930—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>434. For Minister Johnson: Your December 9, 5 p.m., to the Legation.</p>
                <p>The indications are that such a proposal would not be favorably received.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
